tty-colorscheme
------------------------------------------
Simple script to change colors in the linux TTY with 300 colorschemes

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  cygport-0.37.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/red-magic/tty-colorscheme

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/red-magic/tty-colorscheme/archive/refs/tags/1.21.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack tty-colorscheme-1.21-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./tty-colorscheme-1.21-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/tty-colorscheme-1.21-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/tty-colorscheme-1.21-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

